></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>.</li>\n<li>The mental<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/38px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/50px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intelligence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/38px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/50px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/38px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/50px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>.</li>\n<li>Though not mentioned in-game, <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Construct\" title=\"Construct\">constructs</a> are immune to Steeped in Bliss.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Steeped_in_Bliss\">Sources of Steeped in Bliss</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resonance_Stone\" title=\"Resonance Stone\"><picture><source 